      <p style="margin-bottom:18px">This page combines HCM product specialist observations, common buyer feedback themes, model-by-model review summaries, and showroom comparison guidance. It is designed to help shoppers compare Infinity models without replacing the detailed product pages.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:18px">Use this guide to understand what buyers commonly evaluate: <strong style="color:var(--ink)">massage techniques, 4D massage feel, foot massages, foot rollers, calf massage, lumbar heating, body scanning technology, scan technology, gravity positions, space fit, customer service, delivery, and warranty expectations.</strong></p>
